{# Photographer's credit for a picture the site does not host.

   One partial rather than three copies: the banner, the grid and the gallery
   all owe the same line, and a provider that changes what it requires should
   be answered in a single place.

   Two links because the guidelines ask for two things: the photographer, by
   name, and the provider itself. `rel="nofollow noopener"` because they are
   an obligation rather than an endorsement. #}
<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">
    {% if credit.url %}
        <a href="{{ credit.url }}" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:underline">{{ credit.name }}</a>
    {% else %}
        {{ credit.name }}
    {% endif %}
    <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
    <a href="https://www.pexels.com" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" class="hover:underline">Pexels</a>
</p>
